title: M21 Proposed browser journey over the existing agent gateway
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant D as DOM
  participant W as Worker / WASM
  participant H as Web host
  participant A as Agent
  D->>W: Inspect selection
  W->>H: Effect + token
  H->>A: Admitted POST gateway
  A-->>H: Report / error
  H-->>W: View + original token
  W-->>D: Current view only
